  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PL - GIS - GREEN INVESTMENT SCHEME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Green Investment Scheme (GIS) Project is to ensure that the delivered Assigned Amount Units (AAUs) are greened through the implementation of the Polish Green Investment Scheme&apos;s Energy Management in Public Buildings Program.</narrative>
  </description>
